/dist/
# Every binary this module builds, not just the main one. `go build ./tools/x`
# writes ./x into the working directory, and a 3 MB binary was committed that way
# — carrying the build machine's home directory, which is one of the shapes
# tools/audithistory exists to refuse.
/reviewer
/audithistory
/checkadrs
/checklicenses
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
# The plugin compiled. Rebuilt by `npm run build`, and by `make check`
# before the tests that need it, so a tracked copy is only ever a stale one.
plugins/typescript/dist/
